  "description": "D Street Projekt 8 starts with the simplicity of a single speed, then dials up the versatility a notch with 8 terrain conquering speeds from Shimano with a Tektro 315 dual-pivot caliper rear brake. It sports a riser bar that has a 15mm rise and a 680mm width. Alloy 32-hole rims keep things light, stainless steel spokes keep things clean, Kenda 700x28c tires keep things smooth. Like all D Streets, the Projekt 8 is elegant and understated. If flies straight and true, just like you...\nD-Street steel urban road-frameset with vertical dropouts\nForged Alloy 3 piece crank with a 44t chainwheel\nShimano Altus rear derailleur with 8-speed cassette and an Acera Rapidfire Plus shifter\nOversize Alloy riser handlebar with 7° rise A-head stem\n40mm aero double-wall rims with a cassette rear hub and stainless steel spokes\nKenda 700 X 28mm tires",
